---- MODULE CommittedOmmSurvey ----
\* Generated by chart-to-tla.mjs from committed-omm-survey.mmd.
\* Each region is one variable and each transition label is one action.
\* Once you add guards and variables from the real code, this file is the source.
\* statechart.mjs from-chart committed-omm-survey.mmd keeps it, checks it, and compares it with the chart.

VARIABLES flow, kind, code, repoOmm
vars == <<flow, kind, code, repoOmm>>

\* Region Flow
flowStates == {"Asking whether to scan", "Copying committed OMM", "Fact sheet written", "Finding OMM", "Looking up cache", "Reading as is", "Reading cache", "Scanning whole repo", "Survey not started", "Surveying without OMM", "Verifying changed elements"}
\* Region Kind
kindStates == {"Committed OMM", "No committed OMM"}
\* Region Code
codeStates == {"Code caught up", "Code changed since OMM"}
\* Region RepoOmm
repoOmmStates == {"Repo OMM rewritten", "Repo OMM untouched"}

TypeOK ==
    /\ flow \in flowStates
    /\ kind \in kindStates
    /\ code \in codeStates
    /\ repoOmm \in repoOmmStates

Init ==
    /\ flow = "Survey not started"
    /\ kind = "No committed OMM"
    /\ code = "Code caught up"
    /\ repoOmm = "Repo OMM untouched"

\* surveyが始まった
Survey ==
    /\ \/ (flow = "Survey not started" /\ flow' = "Finding OMM")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, code, repoOmm>>

\* コミット済みのOMMがある
OMM ==
    /\ \/ (flow = "Finding OMM" /\ kind = "Committed OMM" /\ flow' = "Copying committed OMM")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, code, repoOmm>>

\* コミット済みのOMMが無い
OMM2 ==
    /\ \/ (flow = "Finding OMM" /\ kind = "No committed OMM" /\ flow' = "Looking up cache")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, code, repoOmm>>

\* 変わったファイルが無かった
Step ==
    /\ \/ (flow = "Copying committed OMM" /\ code = "Code caught up" /\ flow' = "Reading as is")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, code, repoOmm>>

\* 変わったファイルがあった
Step2 ==
    /\ \/ (flow = "Copying committed OMM" /\ code = "Code changed since OMM" /\ flow' = "Verifying changed elements")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, code, repoOmm>>

\* 写しを作れなかった
Step3 ==
    /\ \/ (flow = "Copying committed OMM" /\ flow' = "Surveying without OMM")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, code, repoOmm>>

\* 使える走査があった
Step4 ==
    /\ \/ (flow = "Looking up cache" /\ flow' = "Reading cache")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, code, repoOmm>>

\* 道具が無い
Step5 ==
    /\ \/ (flow = "Looking up cache" /\ flow' = "Surveying without OMM")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, code, repoOmm>>

\* 使える走査が無かった
Step6 ==
    /\ \/ (flow = "Looking up cache" /\ flow' = "Asking whether to scan")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, code, repoOmm>>

\* 走査を選んだ
Step7 ==
    /\ (flow \in {"Asking whether to scan"} \/ (repoOmm = "Repo OMM untouched" /\ flow = "Asking whether to scan" /\ kind = "Committed OMM"))
    /\ \/ (flow = "Asking whether to scan" /\ flow' = "Scanning whole repo")
       \/ (flow \notin {"Asking whether to scan"} /\ UNCHANGED flow)
    /\ \/ (repoOmm = "Repo OMM untouched" /\ flow = "Asking whether to scan" /\ kind = "Committed OMM" /\ repoOmm' = "Repo OMM rewritten")
       \/ (~((repoOmm = "Repo OMM untouched" /\ flow = "Asking whether to scan" /\ kind = "Committed OMM")) /\ UNCHANGED repoOmm)
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, code>>

\* OMMなしを選んだ
OMM3 ==
    /\ \/ (flow = "Asking whether to scan" /\ flow' = "Surveying without OMM")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, code, repoOmm>>

\* 走査をキャッシュに入れた
Step8 ==
    /\ \/ (flow = "Scanning whole repo" /\ flow' = "Reading cache")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, code, repoOmm>>

\* 事実の束を書いた
Step9 ==
    /\ \/ (flow = "Reading as is" /\ flow' = "Fact sheet written")
       \/ (flow = "Verifying changed elements" /\ flow' = "Fact sheet written")
       \/ (flow = "Reading cache" /\ flow' = "Fact sheet written")
       \/ (flow = "Surveying without OMM" /\ flow' = "Fact sheet written")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<kind, code, repoOmm>>

\* .ommをコミットした
Omm ==
    /\ \/ (kind = "No committed OMM" /\ flow = "Survey not started" /\ kind' = "Committed OMM")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<flow, code, repoOmm>>

\* コードだけ変えた
Step10 ==
    /\ \/ (code = "Code caught up" /\ flow = "Survey not started" /\ code' = "Code changed since OMM")
    /\ UNCHANGED <<flow, kind, repoOmm>>

Next == Survey \/ OMM \/ OMM2 \/ Step \/ Step2 \/ Step3 \/ Step4 \/ Step5 \/ Step6 \/ Step7 \/ OMM3 \/ Step8 \/ Step9 \/ Omm \/ Step10

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_vars

\* コミット済みのOMMがあるのに走査するかを聞かない
AskOnCommitted == ~(flow = "Asking whether to scan" /\ kind = "Committed OMM")

\* runがリポジトリの.ommを書き換えない
RewriteRepoOmm == ~(repoOmm = "Repo OMM rewritten" /\ kind = "Committed OMM")

\* 変わったファイルがあるのに照らし合わせずに読まない
TrustStale == ~(flow = "Reading as is" /\ code = "Code changed since OMM")

====
